# Resume markdown

`content/resume.md` is the only content file. Keep this shape so the site can parse it.

Frontmatter keys, in this order: `name`, `role`, `location`, `email`, `phone`, `github`, `linkedin`, `photo`, `tagline`, `availability`.

Sections, in this order: About, Skills, Experience, Projects, Education, Contact.

Experience and Projects use a level-3 heading, then labeled lines, then a Highlights list.

```md
### Job title

- company: Northwind
- dates: 2022 — 2024
- location: Pune
- summary: One sentence on the role.

Highlights:

- Shipped the billing API used by checkout.
```

- One skill group per `###` heading under Skills, with a bullet list.
- Education uses the same labeled-line pattern as Experience (`school`, `dates`, `details`).
- Leave unknown fields empty. Do not delete a heading because a section is still blank.
